<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Journey to 20 - Rahmad M.</title>
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --accent: #D4AF37; /* Emas */
            --dark: #0a0a0a;
            --card: #161616;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: #e0e0e0;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.8), rgba(0,0,0,0.8)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464347601390-25e2842a37f7?q=80&w=2070');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem);
            color: var(--accent);
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Story Section */
        .story-section {
            padding: 120px 20px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .story-card {
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .story-text {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        /* Gallery Frames */
        .gallery-container {
            padding: 100px 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        .aesthetic-frame {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 15px 70px 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            transition: 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
            position: relative;
        }

        .aesthetic-frame:hover {
            transform: translateY(-25px) rotate(2deg);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .aesthetic-frame img {
            width: 320px;
            height: 420px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .frame-label {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            color: #222;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Formspree Section */
        .wish-section {
            padding: 120px 20px;
            background: #0f0f0f;
        }

        .form-box {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--card);
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
        }

        .form-box h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .input-field {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #000;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            color: white;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        textarea.input-field { height: 150px; resize: none; }

        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: black;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover {
            background: var(--white);
            letter-spacing: 6px;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .story-card { padding: 30px 20px; }
            .story-text { font-size: 1.4rem; }
            .aesthetic-frame img { width: 280px; height: 380px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="scroll-bar" style="position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--accent); z-index: 9999; width: 0%;"></div>

    <section class="hero">
        <div data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-duration="2000">
            <h1>TWENTY</h1>
            <p style="letter-spacing: 5px; opacity: 0.7;">RAHMAD M. JOURNEY</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story-section">
        <div class="story-card" data-aos="fade-up">
            <p class="story-text">
                "10 mei 2006 tepat dihari Rabu saya dilahirkan, dengan tangisan pertama, dengan azan seorang ayah, saya mengenal dunia, terimakasih untuk kedua orang tua ku yang sudah merawat ku hingga aku dewasa, hingga aku tahu apa yang benar dan yang salah"
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery-container">
        <div class="aesthetic-frame" data-aos="zoom-in" style="transform: rotate(-2deg);">
            <img src="foto1.jpg" alt="Rahmad M">
            <div class="frame-label">Beginnings</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aesthetic-frame" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
            <img src="foto2.jpg" alt="Rahmad M">
            <div class="frame-label">Growth</div>
        </div>
        <div class="aesthetic-frame" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="400" style="transform: rotate(2deg);">
            <img src="foto3.jpg" alt="Rahmad M">
            <div class="frame-label">Future</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wish-section">
        <div class="form-box" data-aos="fade-up">
            <h2>Send a Wish</h2>
            <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xeenzqjr" method="POST">
                <input type="text" name="name" class="input-field" placeholder="Nama Lengkap" required>
                <input type="email" name="_replyto" class="input-field" placeholder="Email Anda" required>
                <textarea name="message" class="input-field" placeholder="Tuliskan harapan terbaik Anda..." required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Kirim Pesan</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>SINCE 2006 &bull; RAHMAD M. &bull; DEKADE KEDUA</p>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.js"></script>
    <script>
        AOS.init({ duration: 1200, once: true });

        // Scroll Progress Bar
        window.onscroll = function() {
            let winScroll = document.body.scrollTop || document.documentElement.scrollTop;
            let height = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - document.documentElement.clientHeight;
            let scrolled = (winScroll / height) * 100;
            document.getElementById("scroll-bar").style.width = scrolled + "%";
        };
    </script>
</body>
</html>
